Harass your stalked victim with two quick attacks for 35% (at 0 Hate) to 67% (at 100+ Hate) damage each. Each attack that scores a hit disrupts one talent, rune or infusion for [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns. Your opponent will be unnerved by the attacks, reducing the damage they deal by [44%, 47%, 49%, 51%, 52% (TL1-5)] for 2 turns.

This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.
